  "fault_evidence": "An unprivileged seccomp notification supervisor applies only to its own child. Normal operations continue in the Linux kernel. It injects one errno or mutates a private test fixture before kernel pread. It never computes read bytes or protocol output. The injected close-EINTR case skips the actual close; the process exits immediately after its error response and kernel teardown releases the injected residue. Full-read controls additionally grow/link the owned fixture before pread and replace its pathname immediately before the confirmation openat. Invalid UTF-8 is proven to return before that confirmation syscall.",
